<title>USA: Publishing Co gets seven directory pacts.</title>
<headline>Publishing Co gets seven directory pacts.</headline>
<dateline>DELTONA, Fla. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Publishing Co of North America Inc said it has signed multi-year agreements to publish annual directories for seven bar associations in the United States.</p>
<p>The company now publishes directories for more than 80 bar associations nationwide, officials noted.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
